From: Emre Yavuzalp <emreyavuzalp@gmail.com>
Subject: econet-eth: wire up the PPE/FOE hardware offload (stage 2)

Build the recovered PPE sources and hook them into the driver: include
econet_ppe.h, add the en75_ppe handle to the private struct, init/start the
PPE in probe and enable PPE forwarding on each GDM port, stop it on remove,
and commit staged FOE entries from the QDMA RX path on the engine's
learn/unbind completion reasons (crsn 0x0d/0e/0f), logging the first bound
hit (crsn 0x16). Until flows bind the PPE punts everything to the CPU, so
 behaviour is functionally unchanged.
diff -ruN '--exclude=*.orig' a/econet_eth.h b/econet_eth.h
--- a/econet_eth.h	2026-06-28 12:04:02.467507058 +0300
+++ b/econet_eth.h	2026-06-28 12:09:59.347886392 +0300
@@ -207,6 +207,10 @@
